---
import { optionalIntegrations, packages } from '../data/packages';
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="services" class="packages shell section-space" aria-labelledby="packages-heading">
  <div class="section-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Offers</p><h2 id="packages-heading">Built for your<br/><span class="text-muted">next chapter.</span></h2></div><p>A focused first page or a broader business website. Choose a starting point; we’ll agree the scope together.</p></div>
  <div class="pricing-canvas">{packages.map((plan) => <article class:list={['plan', { 'plan-business': plan.name === 'Business' }]}>
    <div class="plan-title"><span class="plan-icon"><Icon name={plan.icon}/></span><div><h3>{plan.name}</h3><p>{plan.description}</p></div></div>
    <p class="price"><span>From</span> <strong>RM{plan.price}</strong></p><div class="plan-scope"><p class="page-scope">{plan.pages}</p><p>{plan.revisions}</p><p class="seo-tier">{plan.seo}</p></div>
    <p class="plan-fit"><strong>Suited to</strong> {plan.suitability}</p>
    <ul class="plan-deliverables" aria-label={`${plan.name} website deliverables`}>{plan.deliverables.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
    <p class="plan-estimate">Estimated build: <strong>{plan.estimate}</strong></p>
    <details class="seo-details"><summary>One-time SEO scope <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{plan.seoDetail}</p></details>
    <a href="#contact" data-package={plan.name} class="plan-link" aria-label={`Enquire about ${plan.name}`}>Enquire about {plan.name} <Arrow diagonal/></a>
  </article>)}</div>
  <div class="scope-context"><h3>Clear scope.<br/>A considered quote.</h3><p>Choose Starter for a single-page introduction, Business when services need their own pages, or Premium for a wider content hierarchy. Every plan includes responsive layouts and clear contact actions.</p><p>SEO is one-time setup and audit work for the agreed pages. Search engines control indexing and rankings; results are not guaranteed. These packages do not include monthly SEO management.</p></div>
  <p class="timeline-note">Working days are Monday–Friday, excluding applicable Malaysian public holidays. Estimates begin only after the scope is agreed, all required materials and the agreed initial payment are received, and a written start date is confirmed. Your written quote confirms the estimated completion date. These are estimates, not guaranteed deadlines; complexity, review delays and changes can affect timing.</p>
  <p class="pricing-note">Prices are starting estimates in Malaysian ringgit (RM), not fixed quotes. You provide the agreed business text, logo and images; content needs, complexity and functionality affect the final quote. Backend systems, databases, e-commerce checkout and operational booking systems are excluded. Domain registration, hosting, ongoing maintenance and licensed third-party services are separate unless the written quote includes them.</p>
  <details class="integration-details"><summary>Optional integrations, quoted separately <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Each option is assessed for your project and quoted separately. Third-party fees, account eligibility, consent and privacy requirements may apply.</p><dl class="integration-list">{optionalIntegrations.map(item => <div><dt>{item.name}</dt><dd>{item.detail}</dd></div>)}</dl></details>
</section>
